sequenceDiagram
    participant Support as Support Agent
    participant UI as Admin Dashboard
    participant API as Identity Broker API
    participant Policy as Policy Service
    participant OPA as OPA Engine
    participant Audit as Audit Service
    participant DB as MariaDB

    Support->>UI: Requests user impersonation
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/policy/decide
    Note over API: action: "impersonate",<br/>actor: "support@admin.com",<br/>subject: "target@acme.com"

    API->>OPA: Evaluate policy (input.roles includes "support-admin")
    OPA-->>API: {allow: true, matched_rule: "allow_impersonate"}

    API->>Audit: Record policy decision
    Audit->>DB: INSERT audit_event (action="impersonate", outcome="ALLOWED")

    API-->>UI: {allowed: true, reason: "Support admin impersonation granted"}

    UI->>API: Switch tenant context to target user's tenant
    Note over API: TenantContext updated to<br/>support admin's tenant scope<br/>(read-only audit context)

    Support->>API: Read user data, entitlements, audit events
    API->>DB: Query with tenant isolation validation
    DB-->>API: Results (read-only context)

    API->>Audit: Record all actions during impersonation session
    Audit->>DB: INSERT audit_event with<br/>actor="support@admin.com",<br/>impersonating="target@acme.com"

    API-->>UI: Display data
    UI-->>Support: View-only access to customer data

    Note over Support,DB: Session ends - impersonation is logged<br/>with full audit trail including<br/>every action taken during session
